{"id":"c3476af232a14478","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeFormulaRow.md","title":"FEncodeFormulaRow","display":"FEncodeFormulaRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FEncodeFormulaRow","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","z4892","z4893","z4894"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FEncodeFormulaRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>z4892</span><span>z4893</span><span>z4894</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶 alpha 编码。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>z4892</code>、<code>z4893</code>、<code>z4894</code>。</p>\n<p>消去绑定名，不消去自由名字区别。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FEncodeFormulaRow E F R f r z4892 z4893 z4894)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists g\n  (exists t\n    (exists u\n      (and\n        (exists z4897 (and (@ Pair t u z4897) (@ Pair g z4897 z4894)))\n        (and\n          (@ FFm E F R f r t)\n          (and\n            (exists w (exists l (and (@ Omega w) (@ SeqTo g l w))))\n            (or\n              (exists z4898\n                (exists z4899\n                  (exists z4900\n                    (exists z4901\n                      (and\n                        (@ FRel z4898 z4899 t)\n                        (and\n                          (@ FRel z4898 z4900 u)\n                          (and\n                            (@ Seq z4899 z4901)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq z4900 z4901)\n                            (forall z4902\n                            (implies\n                            (in z4902 z4901)\n                            (exists z4903\n                            (exists z4904\n                            (and (@ App z4899 z4902 z4903) (and (@ App z4900 z4902 z4904) (@ FEncodeTerm F f g z4903 z4904)))))))))))))))\n              (or\n                (exists z4903\n                  (exists z4904\n                    (exists z4905\n                      (exists z4906\n                        (and\n                          (@ FEq z4903 z4904 t)\n                          (and (@ FEq z4905 z4906 u) (and (@ FEncodeTerm F f g z4903 z4905) (@ FEncodeTerm F f g z4904 z4906))))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z4903\n                    (exists z4904\n                      (and\n                        (@ PNeg z4903 t)\n                        (and\n                          (@ PNeg z4904 u)\n                          (exists z4909\n                            (exists z4910\n                            (and\n                            (in z4909 z4893)\n                            (and (@ App z4892 z4909 z4910) (exists z4911 (and (@ Pair z4903 z4904 z4911) (@ Pair g z4911 z4910)))))))))))\n                  (or\n                    (exists z4903\n                      (exists z4904\n                        (exists z4905\n                          (exists z4906\n                            (and\n                            (@ PImp z4903 z4904 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ PImp z4905 z4906 u)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4912\n                            (exists z4913\n                            (and\n                            (in z4912 z4893)\n                            (and (@ App z4892 z4912 z4913) (exists z4914 (and (@ Pair z4903 z4905 z4914) (@ Pair g z4914 z4913)))))))\n                            (exists z4915\n                            (exists z4916\n                            (and\n                            (in z4915 z4893)\n                            (and (@ App z4892 z4915 z4916) (exists z4917 (and (@ Pair z4904 z4906 z4917) (@ Pair g z4917 z4916))))))))))))))\n                    (exists z4907\n                      (exists z4903\n                        (exists z4904\n                          (exists z4908\n                            (and\n                            (@ FAll z4907 z4903 t)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Cons z4907 g z4908)\n                            (and\n                            (@ FNamelessAll z4904 u)\n                            (exists z4918\n                            (exists z4919\n                            (and\n                            (in z4918 z4893)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z4892 z4918 z4919)\n                            (exists z4920 (and (@ Pair z4903 z4904 z4920) (@ Pair z4908 z4920 z4919))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e67b18d4faf06437\" href=\"?note=e67b18d4faf06437\" title=\"ZFC_Cons\">Cons</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a585a933cab3c7c\" href=\"?note=0a585a933cab3c7c\" title=\"ZFC_FEncodeTerm\">FEncodeTerm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" href=\"?note=f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" title=\"ZFC_FEq\">FEq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75c3ccf26c7ae96b\" href=\"?note=75c3ccf26c7ae96b